      "side": 1,
      "message": "JGit\u0027s writer always puts RIDX in plain (packId, offset) order, so RIDX[0] is always from the lowest pack and the `aPreferred !\u003d bPreferred` branch never runs in the tests. That branch is the part that matters for native git files (`--preferred-pack` on, say, pack 2). Could you add a case to `MultiPackIndexTest.jgit_findBitmapPosition` that rewrites RIDX with pack 2\u0027s entries first and checks every position resolves?",
